    "more": "This holds in every direction. Native peoples have been driven off their lands and killed. Armenians, Jews, Bosnian Muslims, Rohingya and Palestinians have all been expelled and killed in large numbers. People have also called for settlers, majorities and ruling groups to be removed or killed in their turn. A group being small or large, religious or national, colonized or colonizing, does not change what a call to remove all of it means. Wanting an occupation, an apartheid system or a regime to end is a different thing from wanting a people gone, and the first is a legitimate demand that can be made without the second.",
